		"description": "<p>At 1st level, a scoundrel can take advantage of flanking to strike a target where it is most vulnerable. While flanking and not dual-wielding, they deal an extra 1d4 damage to their target once per turn. This damage increases to 2d4 at level 7, 3d4 at level 13, and 4d4 at level 19.</p>",
